  {
   "id": "M1:T45",
   "speaker": "Client",
   "act": "state",
   "guide": "The speaker states the content in their own words.",
   "content": [
    {
     "text": "The VCD creation service of stage 2 VCD simple package has to be improved in order to include the functionalities for considering context specific data and VCD merging.",
