     "text": "A VCD system MUST provide functionality to compile the data which result from the evidence collection process and the data provided by the economic operator in the VCD advanced package creation. The types of data which have to be compiled into a VCD advanced package are therefore: Structural VCD package data Structural data of evidence Tender specific data Economic operator data Context specific data Evidence Authorized translation of evidence",
